{"title":"Cinder Salamander","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 61 Salamander that attacks with burn (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/cinder-salamander\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cinder-salamander?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>79</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cinder-salamander?lv=61\">Lv 61</a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cinder-salamander?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>79</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cinder-salamander?lv=61\" title=\"Pick level 61\"><td><b>61</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>462</td><td>38.1</td><td>3,050</td><td class=\"muted\">1,386 · 53.3 · 9,150</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 6 recorded drops, 182 total, 18–44 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×18–44</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"salamander-crest\" title=\"Salamander Crest - in 4 of 4 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 10 total, 2–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/2b93fad57bcaa0db1d86.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Salamander Crest</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×2–4</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Molten Heart</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 79</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6302\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Salamander: <a href=\"#/monster/old-ashbelly\">Old Ashbelly</a> <span class=\"muted\">(58)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ember-salamander\">Ember Salamander</a> <span class=\"muted\">(59)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/salamander-brood-mother\">Salamander Brood Mother</a> <span class=\"muted\">(61)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/magma-salamander\">Magma Salamander</a> <span class=\"muted\">(63)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/35803bb92041af4a6cc5.svg\" alt=\"Cinder Salamander\"></div><h3>Cinder Salamander</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>61 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 59–59)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Salamander</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>burn · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>462</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>38.1</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3050</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.4 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>2.41</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>6 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}